{"id": "68778", "title": "所谓许诺", "author": "张一天", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68778.htm", "intro": "原本的生活被打乱以后，许诺以为可以守着安仔和家父好好的生活，\r\n可偏偏有一个人死不放手，不死不休的样子让人看了就牙疼，\r\n他忍了又忍终究是放弃了抵抗，任由自己的心思如野草般疯狂生长，沦陷在那人的怀抱中。\r\n罢了，一辈子也就几十年，好端端的跟自己的心闹别扭做什么。\r\n一辈子不长也不短，生活有喜也有悲，那个人不好也不坏恰如四 月阳光。\r\n\r\n内容标签： 高干 强取豪夺", "base": "files/article/html/68/68778", "chapters": [{"title": "1-7", "file": "10545664.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8-13", "file": "10545665.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14-18", "file": "10545666.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19-24", "file": "10545667.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-30", "file": "10545668.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-36", "file": "10545669.html", "available": false}, {"title": "37-42", "file": "10545670.html", "available": false}, {"title": "43-47", "file": "10545671.html", "available": false}, {"title": "48-52", "file": "10545672.html", "available": false}, {"title": "53-57", "file": "10545673.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10545674.html", "available": false}]}